summary: The duplicates panel type

!! Commands

* ``duplicates:activate`` — Duplicates: unfold the group / show the copy (here / other / new)
* ``duplicates:keep`` — Duplicates: keep the copy under the cursor, trash the others
* ``duplicates:toggle-group`` — Duplicates: expand or collapse the group under the cursor
* ``duplicates:trash`` — Duplicates: send the copy under the cursor to the trash

!! Generic commands

Provides ``refresh``, ``index``, ``count``, ``select``, ``entries`` to [[Generic panel commands]].
